@startuml F1.1-D01-dashboard-cache-miss
title F1.1-D01 — Dashboard aluno (cache MISS)
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Aluno" as Aluno
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "DashboardBFF" as BFF
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Aluno -> WebApp: navega /inicio
note right of WebApp: DS/Skeleton nos blocos

WebApp -> Jwt: GET /bff/dashboard/aluno
Jwt -> BFF: JWT ok (dashboard.view_own)
BFF -> Postgres: queries paralelas\n(kpis, pendências, solicitações, eventos…)
Postgres --> BFF: agregados
BFF --> WebApp: 200 + _links

note right of WebApp
  useActions(_links)
  "Nova solicitação" só se
  _links.novaSolicitacao
end note

WebApp --> Aluno: dashboard renderizado

@enduml
